  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.14 No Fees For Certain Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.14 No Fees For Certain Services. No fee shall be charged for any of the following:\n\n(a) Reviewing a course to determine its suitability for pre-licensing education credit;\n\n(b) Filing a complaint or a petition for declaratory ruling; or\n\n(c) Providing a copy of a roster or mailing list.\n\nSource. #13264, INTERIM, eff 9-22-21; ss by #13336, eff 1-27-22; ss by #13390, eff 7-15-22; ss by #14289, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
